actly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-full-support-catalogue"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-full-support-catalogue"],"id":"long.thm-full-support-catalogue","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.14 (Erdős–Borwein full-support irrationality, unconditional)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.14, p. 48, label thm:full-support-catalogue","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every integer $b\\ge2$, the sum $\\sum_{n\\ge1}(b^n-1)^{-1}$ is irrational. This is Erdős’s theorem \\[erdos1948\\]; at base $2$ the sum is the Erdős–Borwein constant. The result concerns full support, not all its infinite subsets.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support-catalogue%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support-catalogue%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","id":"field:2249efe1106dd09e3df2e85649669f1ccf3ae8400934b50fb976a955f75c5dc2","kind":"citation_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.thm-